    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43515" root="&#xA;                        مجن&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقْبَةٌ مَجُونٌ</span></b> 
                         [<i>A stage of a journey,</i> or <i>a march</i>
or <i>journey from one halting-place to another,</i>]
<i>that is far,</i> or <i>distant,</i> or <i>long.</i> (ISk in TA,
voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاسِطَةٌ</span>: but it is not quite clear in my copy
of the TA whether it be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجُونٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجُونٌ</span>.)

